      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-abc9f06eab9d",
      "role": "decorative-annotation",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-beliefs-zh-390.009",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 9,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 172,
      "width": 337,
      "font_family": "Noto Serif CJK SC",
      "font_size": 43,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 48,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "你发送的文字，",
        "不总是你的信念",
        "。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-2b6229724706",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-beliefs-zh-390.010",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 10,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 350,
      "width": 334,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 18,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 29.7,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "一份谨慎的档案，不能只看发送者标签。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-4ce393ffb42a",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-beliefs-zh-390.011",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 11,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 424,
      "width": null,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 11,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 18.15,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#707975",
      "lines": [
        "PAIA · 待审阅的文章草稿"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-b6b352df7872",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-beliefs-zh-390.012",
      "kind": "photograph",
      "paint_order": 12,
      "asset": "light",
      "x": 24,
      "y": 480,
      "width": 342,
      "height": 235,
      "rotation": -0.6,
      "crop_xywh": [
        0.0,
        484.65,
        1500.0,
        1030.7
      ],
      "position": [
        0.5,
        0.5
      ],
      "arch": false
    },
    {
      "id": "article-beliefs-zh-390.013",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 13,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 774,
      "width": 336,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 17,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 29,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#37433b",
      "lines": [
        "设想你把岗位描述发给 AI，请它判断是否适",
        "合自己。那些文字出现在你的消息里，但雇",
        "主的要求不会因此变成你的志向。保存消息",
        "，记录的是一个事实；把每句话都转成你的",
        "偏好，则是另一个缺乏依据的动作。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-22651461e9fe",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-beliefs-zh-390.014",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 14,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 950,
      "width": 336,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 17,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 29,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#37433b",
      "lines": [
        "引文、反方论证、角色扮演、翻译和为别人",
        "写的草稿，都存在同样的问题。即使一句话",
        "完全由你自己写成，它也可能是假设，而不",
        "是结论。它的意义取决于当时正在探索的问",
        "题。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-8b6e4e77bbbe",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-beliefs-zh-390.015",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 15,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 1126,
      "width": 336,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 17,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 29,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#37433b",
      "lines": [
        "因此，PAIA 区分原始表达与对表达的解释。",
        "来源可以告诉你当时发了什么，主题可以帮",
        "助聚合相关材料，AI 整理后的呈现也许更方",
        "便阅读。但它们都不应悄悄成为新的个人真",
        "值。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-89c196ee50ff",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-beliefs-zh-390.016",
      "kind": "line",
      "paint_order": 16,
      "x1": 24,
      "y1": 1322,
      "x2": 104,
      "y2": 1322,
      "stroke": "#a0a99e",
      "stroke_width": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "article-beliefs-zh-390.017",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 17,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 1364,
      "width": 337,
      "font_family": "Noto Serif CJK SC",
      "font_size": 35,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 43,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "真正有用的，",
        "可能是三句话，而不",
        "是三年。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-82a5cd584e11",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-beliefs-zh-390.018",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 18,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 1567,
      "width": 336,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 17,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 29,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#37433b",
      "lines": [
        "好的整理应该给不确定性留下位置。你应当",
        "能查看证据、修改文字、排除某条内容，而",
        "不必对抗一个信心十足的个人叙事。“我正在",
        "考虑”不应该被改写成“我已经决定”。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-8ebc58107c11",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-beliefs-zh-390.019",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 19,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 1714,
      "width": 336,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 17,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 29,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#37433b",
      "lines": [
        "当材料被再次使用时，这个区别尤其重要。",
        "新任务的上下文既需要相关性，也需要每段",
        "文字保持正确的角色。引用仍然是引用，旧",
        "计划可以被标明是旧计划，当前偏好则可以",
        "因为你明确确认而被选中。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-1e3e94664980",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-beliefs-zh-390.020",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 20,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 1890,
      "width": 336,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 17,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 29,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#37433b",
      "lines": [
        "目的不是让档案畏首畏尾，而是让它值得信",
        "任、可以继续使用：结构有用，来源可见，",
        "而最后的判断仍然属于你。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-6e66fd2b5e33",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-beliefs-zh-390.021",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 21,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 2034,
      "width": 335,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 11,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 18.15,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#707975",
      "lines": [
        "这是产品观点，不代表相关能力均已发布。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-02dda9d1f87c",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-beliefs-zh-390.022",
